{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-01_end","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-01","title":"昨日，穀殼將裂","storyCode":"R8-1","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-01_end.txt","sourceHash":"5b2feec7363b96317915d0c5673cd6c5de6d89b96ca429ca19ff9a98b80931e3","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_4"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有砍掉你的手，爬起來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"......別以為事情就這麼完了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在就割了你的舌頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......他跑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"爺爺，您沒事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你都做了啥！啊呀，塔露拉......你看看你都做了啥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，再過兩天我們就要遷村子了。你看看你這樣......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你打了糾察隊啊！這可惹上大麻煩了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"繼續讓他打你更不是辦法。現在已經晚了，他逃了。我現在殺了他，其他人發現他蹤跡的時候，我們就已經遷走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"可那樣我們還是避不過的，糾察隊一旦集結起來，一定還會找上我們。說不定還會報復我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"那你還動手！這該怎麼辦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，爺爺，他們是找感染者。現在他們還不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道我接下來要做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"哎......塔露拉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"爺爺，沒事的。來，我扶你回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"你這條腿......可有得治了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"哈。沒想到我也到了被你攙著這天。我一直覺得我的身體還好著，只是沒想到還是沒逃過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，我有件事，你一定要聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"又是什麼事，爺爺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是什麼來著？唔，哈哈，對不起，我忘啦。你看看，你看我這記性......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"您健忘的症狀還真是挺嚴重的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
